        UPDATE `quest_template` SET `Details` = 'Jang''thraze eludes me, mon... de blood is not enough. We gonna need somethin'' stronger to find it.$B$BWhen you need every troll you got to help out to scrape by, one o'' them dyin'' on ya is a big problem, mon, an'' dat''s why de Sandfury learned to raise our dead wit'' da voodoo. You fall over, you just get back up again and keep workin''... forever!$B$BDe zombies we make be imbued wit'' darkest mojo. You go on to de west an'' find a whole mess o'' dem, an'' get me dat mojo, yah?', `RewMoneyMaxLevel` = 3300 WHERE `entry` = 25026;
